Short landscape note: the 2023 Lula documentary universe for Chapter 2B is concentrated in foreign-policy statements on Ukraine, Israel/Palestine, and Brazil’s handling of regional border tensions with Venezuela/Guyana, plus defense-budget, procurement, and audit records that speak to military resources and accountability. I found a mix of official Brazilian government records, UN/ICJ-facing materials, audit documents, and Reuters-based reporting mirrors that preserve contemporaneous statements and contested reactions.

